A map of the secretary-problem family
The main extensions can be classified according to which component of the classical model is changed.


Secretary Problem


&lt;div class="variant-branch"&gt;

  &lt;div class="variant-branch-title"&gt;
    Information
  &lt;/div&gt;

  &lt;div class="variant-branch-item"&gt;
    Relative ranks
  &lt;/div&gt;

  &lt;div class="variant-branch-item"&gt;
    Full values
  &lt;/div&gt;

  &lt;div class="variant-branch-item"&gt;
    Partial information
  &lt;/div&gt;

  &lt;div class="variant-branch-item"&gt;
